#         rather than conceded". IT IS NOT. F-5 settled edge 2 at two steps
#         and edge 4 carries three: FIVE ORDER-INDEPENDENT STEPS under
#         `mode = "sequence"`, whose cursor refuses any discharge that does
#         not name the step at it (run.rs:1369-1377). Nothing makes knowledge
#         capture precede scope reconciliation, or repeat-pass judgement
