#         THE NEW SUBJECT: the tension is CONCEDED as true and judged cheap,
#         at reduced scale (five steps across two edges, not nineteen on one).
#
#         THE DEFERRAL'S WARRANT IS REPLACED, NOT REPAIRED. "On merit" —
#         nobody needs the mode — is WITHDRAWN AS FALSE. The five steps are
