#
#         A 2a discharge before its subject exists has THREE live causes,
#         not one: (A) the obligation has no real boundary — misclassified;
#         (B) a correctly classified act was falsely or prematurely
#         attested — ordinary noncompliance; (C) the step TEXT misled a
#         compliant agent about when it completes — a wording defect. The
#         raw event cannot tell them apart, so routing it straight to
