#         HALF (ii) TAKES THE SAME CORRECTION. A lone request to gate a
#         lens is also ordinary confusion; it reopens rather than
#         reclassifies, and needs the same contrast against how that run
#         treated the other lenses.
#
#     >>> AMENDED — RV-325 round 6 F-13, owner ruling 2026-08-01. `STAND`
#         IS REMOVED. FOURTH INSTANCE THIS REVIEW of a repair reproducing
