#
#         VA-4 requires every falsifying signal to name a result that WOULD
#         REVISE THE PLACEMENT. An unconditioned `stand` let any firing be
#         narrated after the fact as an anomalous run, with nothing
#         pre-registered selecting that exit — VA-5's route-to-the-cheapest
