#       · "verifier substitutable" is narrower than it sounds: the closed
#         thing is the PLACEHOLDER VOCABULARY a verify argv interpolates
#         (runbook.rs:59-66), substitutable WITHIN an authored asset.
#     The design even anticipates project authorship — RUNBOOK_STEP_ID_BYTES
#     is 64 rather than 32 because 32 "would fit the shipped five while
